{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9e2c5ffe735000463dac63709d786ff66505557042a1215b90cffeed4aaab894", "ja": "（765プロに、ドラマへの出演依頼があった。\nファンタジーもので、主演の勇者役は……未来だ！）", "zh": "（有电视剧邀请765艺能去拍片。\n故事题材为奇幻风格，饰演主角勇者的……是未来！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1001_p", "source_sha256": "0449d812cac954393ae16bbab4d485ff5ae08073a8e57937160ae23c6ab637e9", "ja": "未来、お疲れさま。\n撮影はどうだ、順調か？", "zh": "未来，辛苦你了。\n拍片怎么样？还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "6ceb951e6f386fed752d9f7025ffedfb9a171ec08d5025a35120579940027646", "ja": "{$P$}さん、聞いてください！\n今日は初めて、勇者の衣装を着たんですけど……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你听我说！\n我今天第一次穿上勇者的服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "00c04f8a817e46852df40594be0fea0e91e36c15fd1cfc1882764462bb190d24", "ja": "あれ、鎧がついてて、すご～く重いんです！\n昔の人って、あんな重い服着て戦ってたのかな……？", "zh": "那个上面有铠甲，超～级重的！\n以前的人都是穿那么重的衣服在战斗吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1004_p", "source_sha256": "d93a8ff3f344f0aba47026f418a3b3c6b0295018a853cb63830ccbb4f9c3bfb5", "ja": "多少違うかもしれないけど、重かったとは聞くな。", "zh": "可能细节有些不一样，但我听说是很重。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "afb305657b2311f116c0b2379dc10d5e28932588625400c63fbae79c5b804461", "ja": "おかげで、筋肉痛なんですよ～。それから監督さんに、\n「勇者役なのに、へっぴり腰だ」って言われちゃって。", "zh": "害我的肌肉都酸痛起来了～而且导演还说\n「你明明是勇者，怎么畏头畏尾的」。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "806df2614fc7fd9972e258ddf61e393b7ed52cebb60845700ed697d5f8b8c93d", "ja": "私だけ、殺陣のレッスン増やされちゃいました。\nもうヘトヘトですよ～。", "zh": "独独给我一个人加了武打的练习，\n我已经动不了了啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1007_014mir", "source_sha256": "78f9d271629ff7508d15bd4eb03dbd12edd99107a3e4b023a48a820b54878004", "ja": "剣を「えいっ！」ってすればカッコよく見えるかなって\n思ったんですけど、世の中そんなに甘くないですね～。", "zh": "我还以为挥剑时喊「喝！」会很帅，\n结果这世界根本不是我想的这么简单～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6a7d818c4bbf669f06118676a96a102989f0a3afac67352fc98db9174bab0404", "ja": "はは、そうか。\nでもその割には楽しそうだな、未来。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。\n但你好像挺开心的嘛，未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "812c69523ea18dff3e1a1bcb9df8ca0b086d4ab16bc6bc9268253d1f5af66421", "ja": "えへへ、そうなんです♪\nレッスンは大変ですけど、なんか楽しくって！", "zh": "嘿嘿，没有错♪\n练习虽然很累，但很有趣！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "f62284ec356c453b4a3e48dd10cc1572eb53bf6c64c3e706529d24054f1a5320", "ja": "苦しいのに楽しいのって、どうしてなんだろ。\n{$P$}さん、わかりますか？", "zh": "明明痛苦但又觉得有趣，这是为什么呢？\n{$P$}先生，你知道原因吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1e2c86e429ce6ea60078fc6f5fa009befd76aebfe6e6ade424b2ad9f465d4ddd", "ja": "それはやっぱり、できなかった事が\nできるようになってるからじゃないかな？", "zh": "这一定是因为可以做到\n自己先前做不到的事情吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1c31d07de5049f9d1b1f57d3d0f3968e26f37d0c10067f9e0d17ee0e227b4ac9", "ja": "最初は弱いかもしれないけど……勇者はやっぱり、\nみんなに希望を与える存在でないとな！", "zh": "一开始或许很弱小……\n但勇者就是该带给大家希望的存在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1013_014mir", "source_sha256": "22205be02b4f32f907889494b9d9d00c64312fcfdb5eee3e0ca87f234839ee5d", "ja": "希望を与える存在かぁ……でへへ♪\nなんか、いい響きですね～！", "zh": "带给大家希望的存在……嘿嘿♪\n这听起来挺帅气呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "ce6072fa1e29f3c8ab759c38b813807785220ea488fa65ac955eb1496918a420", "ja": "覚えるセリフがいっぱいあって大変なこと\nいっぱいでしたけど、がんばってよかったかも！", "zh": "虽然要记住的台词很多，还有不少累人的事，\n但我觉得坚持下去是好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_014mir0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_014mir0083_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "3045be4df14d08da9c2a05917d3826eccf49950ecebd153c6a54f5129943a814", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　私、もっともっと\nたくさんの人に見てもらえるように、がんばりますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！我会更加努力，\n让更多的人愿意关注我的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
